{"code":"ar","name":"Arabic","native":"العربية","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"A2","level":{"title":"Elementary: past, future, descriptions, food","goals":["Talk about past and future with correct endings","Describe things with ال and matching adjectives","Shop, order food and ask prices"],"units":[{"id":"A2-U1","title":"Past and future","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U1-L1","title":"Past tense: درستُ","learn":"The past wears SUFFIXES! درستُ (I studied), درستَ (you-m studied), درستِ (you-f studied), درسَ (he studied), درسَتْ (she studied). One stem درسـ + five tails. Your tail tells who!","vocab":[{"t":"أمس","r":"ams","en":"yesterday","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"اليوم","r":"al-yawm","en":"today","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"غدا","r":"ghadan","en":"tomorrow","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"صباحا","r":"ṣabāḥan","en":"in the morning","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"مساء","r":"masāʾan","en":"in the evening","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"ثم","r":"thumma","en":"then","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"قبل","r":"qabla","en":"before","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"بعد","r":"baʿda","en":"after","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Past suffixes: -تُ/-تَ/-تِ/-َ/-َتْ","explain":"درستُ (I), درستَ (you-m), درستِ (you-f), درسَ (he), درسَتْ (she). She adds -تْ to his form! Negate past with ما: ما درستُ = I didn't study.","pattern":"stem + تُ/تَ/تِ/َ/َتْ","examples":[{"t":"درستُ العربية أمس.","r":"darastu al-ʿarabiyya ams.","en":"I studied Arabic yesterday."},{"t":"هي درستْ في المساء.","r":"hiya darasat fī al-masāʾ.","en":"She studied in the evening."},{"t":"ما درستُ.","r":"mā darastu.","en":"I didn't study."}],"mistakes":["Saying درستَ for 'I studied' — I takes درستُ!","Saying هو درستْ — HE takes درسَ (no ت)!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"عمر","t":"ماذا فعلت أمس؟","r":"mādhā faʿalta ams?","en":"What did you do yesterday? (to m)"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"درستُ، ثم خرجتُ.","r":"darastu, thumma kharajtu.","en":"I studied, then I went out."},{"sp":"عمر","t":"وأنا قرأتُ كتابا في المساء.","r":"wa anā qaraʾtu kitāban fī al-masāʾ.","en":"And I read a book in the evening."},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"ممتع!","r":"mumtiʿ!","en":"Fun!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I studied Arabic yesterday","answer":"درستُ العربية أمس"},{"type":"fill","q":"هي ___ في المساء. (studied, f)","answer":"درستْ"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I didn't study' is…","options":["لا درستُ","ما درستُ","لم درستُ","أنا درستُ لا"],"answer":"ما درستُ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: أمس / العربية / درستُ","answer":"درستُ العربية أمس"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: درستُ، ثم خرجتُ.","answer":"درستُ، ثم خرجتُ."}],"quiz":[{"q":"درستُ means…","options":["you studied","I studied","he studied","we studied"],"answer":1,"why":"-تُ = I."},{"q":"درسَتْ means…","options":["I studied","you studied","she studied","they studied"],"answer":2,"why":"-َتْ = she."},{"q":"Past negative uses…","options":["لا","ما","لن","هل"],"answer":1,"why":"ما درستُ = didn't study."},{"q":"أمس means…","options":["today","yesterday","tomorrow","tonight"],"answer":1,"why":"أمس = yesterday."},{"q":"HE-studied is…","options":["درستُ","درستَ","درسَ","ندرس"],"answer":2,"why":"He = bare درسَ."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Past tense worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["yesterday","then","before"],"key":["أمس","ثم","قبل"]},{"instruction":"Pick the tail.","items":["I studied → درست…","you (m) studied → درست…","she studied → درس…"],"key":["درستُ","درستَ","درستْ"]},{"instruction":"Talk yesterday.","items":["I studied, then I went out","Fun!"],"key":["درستُ، ثم خرجتُ","ممتع!"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U1-L2","title":"Future: سأدرس","learn":"Two futures! سـ + present (سأدرس = I will study) for quick plans, سوف + present (سوف أدرس) for bigger ones. Just glue سـ onto the present verb — done!","vocab":[{"t":"قريبا","r":"qarīban","en":"soon","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"بعد قليل","r":"baʿda qalīl","en":"in a little while","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"بعد ساعة","r":"baʿda sāʿa","en":"in an hour","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"الأسبوع القادم","r":"al-usbūʿ al-qādim","en":"next week","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"يوم الاثنين","r":"yawm al-ithnayn","en":"on Monday","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"دائما","r":"dāʾiman","en":"always","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"أحيانا","r":"aḥyānan","en":"sometimes","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"أبدا","r":"abadan","en":"never","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"سـ / سوف + present","explain":"سأدرس (I will study), ستدرس (you will), سيدرس (he will). سوف أدرس = same, grander. Negate future with لن: لن أذهب = I won't go.","pattern":"سـ/سوف + present · لن negates","examples":[{"t":"سأدرس العربية.","r":"sa-adrus al-ʿarabiyya.","en":"I will study Arabic."},{"t":"سوف نتكلم!","r":"sawfa natakallam!","en":"We will speak!"},{"t":"لن أذهب.","r":"lan adhhab.","en":"I won't go."}],"mistakes":["Gluing سـ to the PAST: سـ loves PRESENT verbs!","Negating future with ما — future needs لن!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ليلى","t":"ماذا ستفعل غدا؟","r":"mādhā sat-tafʿal ghadan?","en":"What will you do tomorrow? (to m)"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"سأدرس العربية. وأنتِ؟","r":"sa-adrus al-ʿarabiyya. wa anti?","en":"I will study Arabic. And you? (to f)"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"سأعمل، ثم سأخرج.","r":"sa-aʿmal, thumma sa-akhruj.","en":"I will work, then I will go out."},{"sp":"عمر","t":"أراك قريبا!","r":"arāk qarīban!","en":"See you soon!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I will study Arabic","answer":"سأدرس العربية"},{"type":"fill","q":"لن ___. (I go)","answer":"أذهب"},{"type":"choose","q":"'We will speak!' is…","options":["نتكلم","سوف نتكلم","تكلمنا","سنتكلم أمس"],"answer":"سوف نتكلم"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: العربية / سأدرس","answer":"سأدرس العربية"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: سأدرس العربية.","answer":"سأدرس العربية."}],"quiz":[{"q":"سأدرس means…","options":["I study","I studied","I will study","I want study"],"answer":2,"why":"سـ + present = future."},{"q":"Future negative is…","options":["ما","لا","لن","لم"],"answer":2,"why":"لن أذهب = won't go."},{"q":"قريبا means…","options":["later","soon","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"قريبا = soon."},{"q":"أبدا means…","options":["sometimes","always","never","soon"],"answer":2,"why":"أبدا = never."},{"q":"سـ attaches to…","options":["past verbs","present verbs","nouns","adjectives"],"answer":1,"why":"سأدرس — present stem."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Future worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["soon","always","never"],"key":["قريبا","دائما","أبدا"]},{"instruction":"Make futures.","items":["I will study","We will speak","I won't go"],"key":["سأدرس","سوف نتكلم","لن أذهب"]},{"instruction":"Plan tomorrow.","items":["What will you do tomorrow? (m)","See you soon!"],"key":["ماذا ستفعل غدا؟","أراك قريبا!"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U2","title":"Descriptions","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U2-L1","title":"Adjectives: الكتاب الكبير","learn":"Describe everything! Adjectives FOLLOW nouns and MATCH: الكتاب الكبير (the big book), السيارة الكبيرة (the big car-f). ال on BOTH words! Without ال: كتاب كبير (a big book) — match but no ال!","vocab":[{"t":"مدينة","r":"madīna","en":"city","pos":"noun"},{"t":"شارع","r":"shāriʿ","en":"street","pos":"noun"},{"t":"محل","r":"maḥall","en":"shop","pos":"noun"},{"t":"عمل","r":"ʿamal","en":"work","pos":"noun"},{"t":"حديقة","r":"ḥadīqa","en":"garden / park","pos":"noun"},{"t":"متحف","r":"matḥaf","en":"museum","pos":"noun"},{"t":"محطة","r":"maḥaṭṭa","en":"station","pos":"noun"},{"t":"جديد","r":"jadīd","en":"new","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"Noun + matching adjective","explain":"كتاب كبير (a big book), الكتاب الكبير (THE big book). Feminine: سيارة كبيرة. Sun letters (ت ث د ذ ر ز س ش ص ض ط ظ ل ن) swallow the L: الشارع = ash-shāriʿ!","pattern":"noun + adj (both ال or both bare)","examples":[{"t":"الكتاب الكبير.","r":"al-kitāb al-kabīr.","en":"The big book."},{"t":"سيارة جديدة.","r":"sayyāra jadīda.","en":"A new car."},{"t":"الشارع الجديد.","r":"ash-shāriʿ al-jadīd.","en":"The new street."}],"mistakes":["Saying الكتاب كبير for 'the big book' — needs الكتاب الكبير!","Saying سيارة كبير — feminine needs كبيرة!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ليلى","t":"أين الشارع الجديد؟","r":"ayna ash-shāriʿ al-jadīd?","en":"Where is the new street?"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"الشارع الجديد قريب.","r":"ash-shāriʿ al-jadīd qarīb.","en":"The new street is near."},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"والحديقة الكبيرة؟","r":"wa al-ḥadīqa al-kabīra?","en":"And the big garden?"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"بعيدة!","r":"baʿīda!","en":"Far!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: The big book","answer":"الكتاب الكبير"},{"type":"fill","q":"سيارة ___ (new, f)","answer":"جديدة"},{"type":"choose","q":"'The new street' is…","options":["شارع جديد","الشارع الجديد","الشارع جديد","شارع الجديد"],"answer":"الشارع الجديد"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: الكبير / الكتاب","answer":"الكتاب الكبير"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: أين الشارع الجديد؟","answer":"أين الشارع الجديد؟"}],"quiz":[{"q":"الكتاب الكبير has ال twice because…","options":["plural","'the big book' needs both","formal","past tense"],"answer":1,"why":"ال-noun + ال-adj = the X-the Y."},{"q":"سيارة جديدة means…","options":["the new car","a new car","new cars","my car"],"answer":1,"why":"Bare + bare = a new car."},{"q":"الشمس pronounces…","options":["al-shams","ash-shams","el-shams","as-shams"],"answer":1,"why":"ش is a sun letter — L swallowed!"},{"q":"حديقة means…","options":["street","garden","station","shop"],"answer":1,"why":"حديقة = garden/park."},{"q":"جديد means…","options":["old","new","big","near"],"answer":1,"why":"جديد = new."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Adjectives worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["city","museum","new"],"key":["مدينة","متحف","جديد"]},{"instruction":"Describe.","items":["the big book","a new car","the new street"],"key":["الكتاب الكبير","سيارة جديدة","الشارع الجديد"]},{"instruction":"Find places.","items":["Where is the new street?","Far!"],"key":["أين الشارع الجديد؟","بعيدة!"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U2-L2","title":"Places: في، إلى، من","learn":"Move around! في (in/at), إلى (to), من (from): في البيت (at home), إلى المدرسة (to school), من مصر (from Egypt). أين؟ (where?) vs إلى أين؟ (where to?) — tiny إلى, big difference!","vocab":[{"t":"القاهرة","r":"al-qāhira","en":"Cairo","pos":"noun"},{"t":"مصر","r":"miṣr","en":"Egypt","pos":"noun"},{"t":"مكتب","r":"maktab","en":"office / desk","pos":"noun"},{"t":"طاولة","r":"ṭāwila","en":"table","pos":"noun"},{"t":"درس","r":"dars","en":"lesson","pos":"noun"},{"t":"حفلة","r":"ḥafla","en":"party / concert","pos":"noun"},{"t":"سينما","r":"sīnimā","en":"cinema","pos":"noun"},{"t":"بيت","r":"bayt","en":"house","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"في / إلى / من","explain":"أنا في البيت (I'm at home), أذهب إلى المدرسة (I go to school), أنا من مصر (I'm from Egypt). Verbs of going demand إلى!","pattern":"في (at) · إلى (to) · من (from)","examples":[{"t":"أنا في البيت.","r":"anā fī al-bayt.","en":"I'm at home."},{"t":"أذهب إلى المدرسة.","r":"adhhab ilā al-madrasa.","en":"I go to school."},{"t":"أنا من مصر.","r":"anā min miṣr.","en":"I'm from Egypt."}],"mistakes":["Saying أذهب في المدرسة — going needs إلى!","Saying أنا إلى مصر for origin — from = من!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"عمر","t":"أين تسكن؟","r":"ayna taskun?","en":"Where do you live? (to m)"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"أسكن في القاهرة.","r":"askun fī al-qāhira.","en":"I live in Cairo."},{"sp":"عمر","t":"وأنا من مصر أيضا!","r":"wa anā min miṣr ayḍan!","en":"And I'm from Egypt too!"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"رائع!","r":"rāʾiʿ!","en":"Wonderful!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I live in Cairo","answer":"أسكن في القاهرة"},{"type":"fill","q":"أذهب ___ المدرسة. (to)","answer":"إلى"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I'm from Egypt' is…","options":["أنا في مصر","أنا إلى مصر","أنا من مصر","أنا مصر"],"answer":"أنا من مصر"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: القاهرة / في / أسكن","answer":"أسكن في القاهرة"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: أسكن في القاهرة.","answer":"أسكن في القاهرة."}],"quiz":[{"q":"إلى means…","options":["in","to","from","at"],"answer":1,"why":"إلى = to (going)."},{"q":"من means…","options":["to","in","from","near"],"answer":2,"why":"من = from."},{"q":"أذهب إلى المدرسة means…","options":["I'm at school","I go to school","I'm from school","I see school"],"answer":1,"why":"أذهب + إلى = go to."},{"q":"إلى أين؟ asks…","options":["where at","where to","where from","where near"],"answer":1,"why":"إلى أين = where-to."},{"q":"القاهرة is…","options":["Egypt","Cairo","a school","a river"],"answer":1,"why":"القاهرة = Cairo."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Places worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["Cairo","table","cinema"],"key":["القاهرة","طاولة","سينما"]},{"instruction":"في/إلى/من.","items":["I'm at home","I go to school","I'm from Egypt"],"key":["أنا في البيت","أذهب إلى المدرسة","أنا من مصر"]},{"instruction":"Where?","items":["Where do you live? (m)","Wonderful!"],"key":["أين تسكن؟","رائع!"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U3","title":"Food and shopping","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U3-L1","title":"Food and أحب","learn":"Food + love! أحب الشاي (I love tea), أريد قهوة (I want coffee). أريد + noun orders anything. In restaurants: أريد… من فضلك = I want… please — polite ordering power!","vocab":[{"t":"حليب","r":"ḥalīb","en":"milk","pos":"noun"},{"t":"جبن","r":"jubn","en":"cheese","pos":"noun"},{"t":"لحم","r":"laḥm","en":"meat","pos":"noun"},{"t":"سمك","r":"samak","en":"fish","pos":"noun"},{"t":"تفاح","r":"tuffāḥ","en":"apples","pos":"noun"},{"t":"شاي","r":"shāy","en":"tea","pos":"noun"},{"t":"قهوة","r":"qahwa","en":"coffee","pos":"noun"},{"t":"سكر","r":"sukkar","en":"sugar","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"أحب / أريد + noun","explain":"أحب الشاي (I love tea), أحب القهوة (I love coffee-f but verb stays!). أريد شايا؟ Simplify: أريد شاي (I want tea). من فضلك softens every order!","pattern":"أحب/أريد + noun + من فضلك","examples":[{"t":"أحب الجبن.","r":"uḥibb al-jubn.","en":"I love cheese."},{"t":"أريد شايا من فضلك.","r":"urīd shāyan min faḍlik.","en":"I want tea, please."},{"t":"أحب السمك.","r":"uḥibb as-samak.","en":"I love fish."}],"mistakes":["Changing أحب for feminine food — the VERB never changes for objects!","Forgetting من فضلك — orders need please!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ليلى","t":"ماذا تحب؟","r":"mādhā tuḥibb?","en":"What do you love? (to m)"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"أحب الجبن والخبز. وأنتِ؟","r":"uḥibb al-jubn wa al-khubz. wa anti?","en":"I love cheese and bread. And you? (to f)"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"أحب السمك. أريد شايا!","r":"uḥibb as-samak. urīd shāyan!","en":"I love fish. I want tea!"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"وأنا أريد قهوة!","r":"wa anā urīd qahwa!","en":"And I want coffee!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I love cheese","answer":"أحب الجبن"},{"type":"fill","q":"أريد ___ من فضلك. (tea)","answer":"شايا"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I want coffee!' is…","options":["أحب قهوة","أريد قهوة","أشرب قهوة","آكل قهوة"],"answer":"أريد قهوة"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: الجبن / أحب","answer":"أحب الجبن"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: أحب الجبن والخبز.","answer":"أحب الجبن والخبز."}],"quiz":[{"q":"أريد means…","options":["I love","I want","I eat","I drink"],"answer":1,"why":"أريد = I want."},{"q":"أحب الجبن means…","options":["I want cheese","I love cheese","I eat cheese","I buy cheese"],"answer":1,"why":"أحب = I love."},{"q":"جبن means…","options":["milk","cheese","meat","fish"],"answer":1,"why":"جبن = cheese."},{"q":"Verbs change for…","options":["objects","subjects only","nothing","gender of food"],"answer":1,"why":"أحب stays أحب — subject decides!"},{"q":"Orders add…","options":["شكرا after","من فضلك","عفوا before","نعم"],"answer":1,"why":"من فضلك = polite please."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Food worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["cheese","fish","tea"],"key":["جبن","سمك","شاي"]},{"instruction":"Love and want.","items":["I love cheese","I love fish","I want tea, please"],"key":["أحب الجبن","أحب السمك","أريد شايا من فضلك"]},{"instruction":"Ask tastes.","items":["What do you love? (m)","And I want coffee!"],"key":["ماذا تحب؟","وأنا أريد قهوة!"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U3-L2","title":"Shopping: بكم","learn":"Shop in Arabic! بكم هذا؟ (How much is this?), غالٍ (expensive), رخيص (cheap). Money: جنيه (pound), ريال (riyal). آخذ هذا = I'll take this!","vocab":[{"t":"سعر","r":"siʿr","en":"price","pos":"noun"},{"t":"مال","r":"māl","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"جنيه","r":"junayh","en":"pound","pos":"noun"},{"t":"إيصال","r":"īṣāl","en":"receipt","pos":"noun"},{"t":"خصم","r":"khaṣm","en":"discount","pos":"noun"},{"t":"غال","r":"ghāl","en":"expensive","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"رخيص","r":"rakhīṣ","en":"cheap","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"مجانا","r":"majjānan","en":"free","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"بكم هذا؟ = How much?","explain":"بكم هذا؟ (How much is this?), بكم الخبز؟ (How much is the bread?). Answer: بعشرة جنيه (for ten pounds). هذا غالٍ! = This is expensive!","pattern":"بكم + this/thing?","examples":[{"t":"بكم هذا؟","r":"bikam hādhā?","en":"How much is this?"},{"t":"بعشرة جنيه.","r":"bi-ʿashara junayh.","en":"For ten pounds."},{"t":"هذا غال! آخذ هذا.","r":"hādhā ghāl! ākhudh hādhā.","en":"This is expensive! I'll take this."}],"mistakes":["Saying كم سعر بدون ب — prices need بكم!","Forgetting هذا: بكم هذا؟ needs its THIS!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ليلى","t":"بكم الخبز؟","r":"bikam al-khubz?","en":"How much is the bread?"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"بعشرة جنيه.","r":"bi-ʿashara junayh.","en":"For ten pounds."},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"غال! والجبن؟","r":"ghāl! wa al-jubn?","en":"Expensive! And the cheese?"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"رخيص! آخذ هذا!","r":"rakhīṣ! ākhudh hādhā!","en":"Cheap! I'll take this!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How much is the bread?","answer":"بكم الخبز؟"},{"type":"fill","q":"بعشرة ___. (pounds)","answer":"جنيه"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I'll take this!' is…","options":["أريد هذا!","آخذ هذا!","أذهب هذا!","آكل هذا!"],"answer":"آخذ هذا!"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: الخبز / بكم","answer":"بكم الخبز"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: بكم الخبز؟","answer":"بكم الخبز؟"}],"quiz":[{"q":"بكم هذا؟ means…","options":["How many?","How much is this?","Where is this?","What is this?"],"answer":1,"why":"بكم = for-how-much."},{"q":"غال means…","options":["cheap","expensive","free","new"],"answer":1,"why":"غال = expensive."},{"q":"رخيص means…","options":["cheap","expensive","tasty","big"],"answer":0,"why":"رخيص = cheap."},{"q":"خصم means…","options":["receipt","discount","price","shop"],"answer":1,"why":"خصم = discount."},{"q":"آخذ هذا means…","options":["I want this","I'll take this","I go here","I see this"],"answer":1,"why":"آخذ = I take."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Shopping worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["price","discount","cheap"],"key":["سعر","خصم","رخيص"]},{"instruction":"Shop talk.","items":["How much is the bread?","For ten pounds","I'll take this!"],"key":["بكم الخبز؟","بعشرة جنيه","آخذ هذا!"]},{"instruction":"React.","items":["Expensive!","Cheap!"],"key":["غال!","رخيص!"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"A2 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I studied Arabic yesterday","answer":"درستُ العربية أمس"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I will study Arabic","answer":"سأدرس العربية"},{"type":"choose","q":"'The big book'","options":["كتاب كبير","الكتاب الكبير","الكتاب كبير","كتاب الكبير"],"answer":"الكتاب الكبير"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"أسكن في القاهرة.","answer":"I live in Cairo."},{"type":"fill","q":"هي ___ في المساء. (studied, f)","answer":"درستْ"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I'm from Egypt'","options":["أنا في مصر","أنا إلى مصر","أنا من مصر","أنا مصر"],"answer":"أنا من مصر"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: القاهرة / في / أسكن","answer":"أسكن في القاهرة"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: أحب الجبن والخبز.","answer":"أحب الجبن والخبز."},{"type":"fill","q":"بكم ___؟ (this, m)","answer":"هذا"},{"type":"choose","q":"لن أذهب.","options":["I go","I won't go","I went","I want go"],"answer":"I won't go"}]}}}